<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-10518] MVCC: Update operation may hangs on backup on unstable topology. </title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-10518</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Update operation may hangs on backup awaiting next topology.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Symptoms:&#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Exchange for topology version 6.1 has been finished.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Exchange for topology version 6.2 awaits for partition release.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;DhtTxRemote waits for exchange.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;


&lt;p&gt;Seems, tx maps on outdated topology version.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Reproducer&#160;IgniteTxCachePrimarySyncTest.testSingleKeyCommit()&#160; in&#160;Mvcc mode.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
